BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (Confirm collection authority, owner waterfall, refundable-deposit treatment, and collision-deductible) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (responsibility in signed contracts.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (Require cleared funds, condition photographs, a unique VIN reservation, and a booked first-settlement) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (review before handover.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 648.10 Tm (2. Build the six-module ledger and make retries economically harmless) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 625.87 Tm (operating_framework) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 603.65 Tm (Use SQLite for a single-host small-team deployment, with the database on durable local storage rather than) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 588.42 Tm (a shared network filesystem. The six reference modules below concatenate in numerical order into one) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 573.20 Tm (Python 3.9 script. They use integer cents, foreign keys, unique business keys, explicit transactions,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 557.97 Tm (immutable journal rows, and a unique active reservation per VIN. BEGIN IMMEDIATE serializes competing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 542.75 Tm (writers before they read balances or change assignments, eliminating check-then-write races inside this) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 527.52 Tm (deployment boundary. A reused request key with a different payload fails instead of silently overwriting) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 512.30 Tm (history. Journal creation and its lines commit together; a process crash cannot leave a partially posted entry) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 497.07 Tm (through the provided write functions. Keep raw database access behind the trusted service account because) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 481.85 Tm (direct SQL can bypass application-level business rules. Store encrypted documents outside the ledger and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 466.62 Tm (retain only evidence references here. Configure encrypted backups, restoration tests, access logging, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 451.40 Tm (monitored disk capacity before live collection. These snippets are a reference implementation, not a tested) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 436.17 Tm (installation report. Their assertions must pass against the deployment's actual adapter, retention policy, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 420.95 Tm (permission model before real vehicles or money depend on them.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 405.72 Tm (The verification and funds-held state machine deliberately separates evidence from cash. A reviewer) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 390.50 Tm (records coverage, permit, driver, and contract evidence with a shared earliest expiry timestamp. Funding) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 375.27 Tm (requires a confirmed bank reference; a submitted payment instruction is insufficient. The same funding) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 360.05 Tm (reference cannot credit two applications because its global request key includes the immutable payload) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 344.82 Tm (digest. Activation checks the evidence deadline, deposit threshold, and exclusive VIN reservation inside the) Tj ET
